    "张骞在公元前二世纪出使西域。",
    "商品、技术、宗教和知识沿多条路线传播。"
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "UNESCO: About the Silk Roads",
      "url": "https://en.unesco.org/silkroad/about-silk-roads"
    }
  ],
